  "description": "Accessibility test tooling for Razor components, built on bUnit: a WAI-ARIA rule engine (roles, states, ID references, required owned elements and context, accessible names, focusable content in hidden subtrees, nested interactive controls ...), accessible-name and focus-order inspection, keyboard helpers and a recording live-region announcer. Framework-neutral, so it works with MSTest, xUnit or NUnit; first-class support for Bit.Bheadless.",
